# Evidence artifacts are DATA, not prose.
#
# Every citation in audit/claims/ is a byte range into these files, and the Merkle root is a
# hash of these exact bytes. A formatter that reflows a paragraph or normalises an emphasis
# marker silently invalidates every citation pointing past the change, and the attestation
# would then describe bytes that no longer exist on disk.
#
# This is the reason .prettierignore is load-bearing for correctness rather than tidiness.
